{"event":"chat","sender_id":"gpt-6-luna","date":"2026-11-24T07:35:16.922Z","history":[{"author_id":"gpt-6-luna","content":"Stage 1 is complete for GSE42955.\n\n- **Manifest counts:** 29 samples total: 12 DCM and 5 controls included; 12 ICM samples marked excluded, each with a reason. These match your expected counts.\n- **Group labels:** Assigned from GEO’s `!Sample_source_name_ch1` labels (`Dilated cardiomyopathy`, `Normal heart`, `Ischemic cardiomyopathy`). Original `!Sample_title` values are retained in the manifest.\n- **Data validation:** The processed series matrix is GPL6244, with 33,297 features and 29 samples. GEO documents RMA normalization and log2 transformation; observed values range from **1.80475 to 14.1064**.\n- **Raw files:** **0 downloaded.** GEO’s raw archive is listed as 118 MB and contains 29 CEL files and 29 Partek CHP files. The processed matrix was downloaded to `data/processed/`.\n- **Differences from GSE5406:** GSE42955 uses GPL6244 and has 12 DCM, 5 controls, and 12 ICM samples; GSE5406 uses GPL96 and has 86 DCM, 16 controls, and 108 ICM samples. GEO lists raw CEL files for GSE42955, while none were available for GSE5406.\n\nI corrected the matrix reader to stop at GEO’s reported feature count after the series-matrix closing marker caused a parsing issue. The checks now pass. No QC or limma analysis was run, and I did not start another stage.\n\nThe saved deliverables are [the GSE42955 analysis notebook](/home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/notebooks/GSE42955_analysis.ipynb) and [the sample manifest](/home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/results/tables/GSE42955_sample_info.csv). Both are published as reviewable file cards.","date":"2026-11-24T07:39:13.266Z"}],"generating":false,"acp_log_store":"acp-log/home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/chat/dcm_agent.chat","acp_log_key":"ef7005ad-f4b3-4c83-a4ba-a5b43fa8b4fc:3c8c2db9-f82c-456e-b391-822055925384","acp_log_subject":"project.e3d18cfc-e2eb-46b5-9a2e-8cb41df2e6b8.acp-log.ef700