{"event":"chat","sender_id":"gpt-6-luna","date":"2026-11-24T07:41:13.707Z","history":[{"author_id":"gpt-6-luna","content":"Stage 2 is complete for GSE42955. The processed matrix is on GEO’s RMA-normalized log2 scale; the 17 included samples range from **1.83259 to 14.1064**.\n\nThere were **0 missing values, 0 non-finite values, and 0 zero-variance features**. All 33,297 features were used for QC. Expression distributions looked broadly similar. **GSM1053915 and GSM1053918** are possible outliers: both separate from the main group in PCA/MDS and have long branches in the clustering dendrogram. These are flags for review; **all 17 samples remain included**.\n\nThe notebook records the steps, findings, and session information. No limma model was fit, and I did not commit anything.\n\n- [GSE42955 analysis notebook](</home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/notebooks/GSE42955_analysis.ipynb>)\n- [Expression distributions](</home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/results/figures/GSE42955_expression_distributions.png>)\n- [PCA](</home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/results/figures/GSE42955_PCA.png>)\n- [MDS](</home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/results/figures/GSE42955_MDS.png>)\n- [Sample clustering](</home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/results/figures/GSE42955_sample_clustering.png>)","date":"2026-11-24T07:43:45.402Z"}],"generating":false,"acp_log_store":"acp-log/home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/chat/dcm_agent.chat","acp_log_key":"ef7005ad-f4b3-4c83-a4ba-a5b43fa8b4fc:1eed835c-02c6-477b-8c68-e38c64c5cd08","acp_log_subject":"project.e3d18cfc-e2eb-46b5-9a2e-8cb41df2e6b8.acp-log.ef7005ad-f4b3-4c83-a4ba-a5b43fa8b4fc.1eed835c-02c6-477b-8c68-e38c64c5cd08","acp_started_at_ms":1795506073504,"acp_working_directory":"/home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/chat","acp_account_id":"6b19db69-db29-4124-a317-7e98612efdde","acp_runtime_kind":"codex","message_id":"1eed835c-02c6-477b-8c68-e38c64c5cd08","thread_id":"ef7005ad-f4b3-4c83-a4ba-a5b43fa8b4fc"