{"event":"chat","sender_id":"gpt-6-luna","date":"2026-11-24T07:46:03.181Z","history":[{"author_id":"gpt-6-luna","content":"**GSE42955 Stage 3 is complete** using all 17 included samples (5 controls, 12 DCM); no samples were excluded, and consensus analysis was not started.\n\nThe GPL6244 annotation had no explicit control-probe class field. I applied the documented Affymetrix control-ID prefix screen; it identified **0 control probes**, leaving **33,297 probes tested**. This annotation limitation is documented in the notebook.\n\nWith Control as the reference and BH adjusted $p < 0.05$, **8 probes were significant**; **4** had $|\\mathrm{log2FC}| \\ge 1$. The selected gene-symbol table has 19,036 symbols, including 6 significant symbols.\n\nTop-ranked probe: **7897378 (PER3)** — control mean **7.069542**, DCM mean **6.009144**, log2FC (DCM minus control) **−1.060398**, adjusted $p = 0.001879854$.\n\nReference-setting code:\n\n```r\nfactor(assigned_group, levels = c(\"Control\", \"DCM\"))\nmodel.matrix(~ assigned_group, data = analysis_manifest)\n```\n\nThe notebook and four tables are saved and published:\n\n- [GSE42955 analysis notebook](/home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/notebooks/GSE42955_analysis.ipynb)\n- [Complete probe-level results](/home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/results/tables/GSE42955_limma_probe_level_all.csv)\n- [Selected gene-symbol results](/home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/results/tables/GSE42955_limma_gene_symbol_selected.csv)\n- [Significant probe-level results](/home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/results/tables/GSE42955_limma_probe_level_significant.csv)\n- [Significant gene-symbol results](/home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/results/tables/GSE42955_limma_gene_symbol_significant.csv)\n\nThe notebook includes the model steps and session information. No commit was made.","date":"2026-11-24T07:51:20.665Z"}],"generating":false,"acp_log_store":"acp-log/home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/chat/dcm_agent.chat","acp_log_key":"ef7005ad-f4b3-4c83-a4ba-a5b43fa8b4fc:67a9fdfd-6b26-46a8-916c-14f51b05a6cf","acp_log_subject":"project.e3d18cfc-e2eb-46b5-9a2e-8cb41df2e6b8.acp-log.ef7005ad-f4b3-4c83-a4ba-a5b43fa8b4fc.67a9fdfd-6b26-46a8-916c-14f51b05a6cf","acp_started_at_ms":1795506362788,"acp_working_directory":"/home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/chat","acp_account_id":"6b19db69-db29-4124-a317-7e98612efdde","acp_runtime_kind":"codex","message_id":"67a9fdfd-6b26-46a8-916c-14f51b05a6cf","thread_id":"ef7005ad-f4b3-4c83-a4ba-a5b43fa8b4fc","parent_message_id":"ac35712b-52b1-432e-81d3-b90392510aa3","acp_thread_id":"01a20c06-79b7-78a3-8b91-8c2a6fe6b5a3","acp_usage":{"input_tokens":69078,"cached_input_tokens":64824,"output_tokens":659,"reasoning_output_tokens":194,"total_tokens":69737,"model_context_window":121600},"acp_manager_finished":true,"acp_active_descendant_thread_ids":[],"acp_active_descendant_agents":0,"acp_subagent_limit_exceeded":false,"acp_background_terminal_processes":0,"acp_ai_usage_may_continue":false}
{"event":"chat","sender_id":"gpt-6-luna","date":"2026-11-24T08:01:59.853Z","history":[{"author_id":"gpt-6-luna","content":"RMA’s quantile normalization assumes arrays should have the same overall expression distribution, with broad distribution differences mainly reflecting technical effects. That is a reasonable standard choice for these 17 samples on the same GPL6244 platform, though a true genome-wide shift between groups could challenge the assumption.\n\nWe have **post-normalization** expression distribution plots only. The analysis used GEO’s processed RMA log2 matrix; raw CEL files were not downloaded, so there are no before-and-after plots. The existing plot is [GSE42955 expression distributions](/home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/results/figures/GSE42955_expression_distributions.png).","date":"2026-11-24T08:02:11.465Z"}],"generating":false,"acp_log_store":"acp-log/home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/chat/dcm_agent.chat","acp_log_key":"ef7005ad-f4b3-4c83-a4ba-a5b43fa8b4fc:4e826d5b-c2dd-4440-b51c-319fd6d0b347","acp_log_subject":"project.e3d18cfc-e2eb-46b5-9a2e-8cb41df2e6b8.acp-log.ef7005ad-f4b3-4c83-a4ba-a5b43fa8b4fc.4e826d5b-c2dd-4440-b51c-319fd6d0b347","acp_started_at_ms":1795507318971,"acp_working_directory":"/home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/chat","acp_account_id":"6b19db69-db29-4124-a317-7e98612efdde","acp_runtime_kind":"codex","message_id":"4e826d5b-c2dd-4440-b51c-319fd6d0b347","thread_id":"ef7005ad-f4b3-4c83-a4ba-a5b43fa8b4fc","parent_message_id":"a03070fb-8596-4de9-addb-a00d08a164a8","acp_thread_id":"01a20c06-79b7-78a3-8b91-8c2a6fe6b5a3","acp_usage":{"input_tokens":77716,"cached_input_tokens":72938,"output_tokens":425,"reasoning_output_tokens":280,"total_tokens":78141,"model_context_window":121600},"acp_manager_finished":true,"acp_active_descendant_thread_ids":[],"acp_active_descendant_agents":0,"acp_subagent_limit_exceeded":false,"acp_background_terminal_processes":0,"acp_ai_usage_may_continue":false}
{"event":"chat","sender_id":"gpt-6-luna","date":"2026-11-24T08:08:48.464Z","history":[{"author_id":"gpt-6-luna","content":"Created and saved the R-kernel notebook [Consensus_analysis.ipynb](/home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/notebooks/Consensus_analysis.ipynb) and published its file card.\n\n| Study | Selected gene symbols |\n|---|---:|\n| GSE5406 | 12,650 |\n| GSE42955 | 19,036 |\n| Shared symbols | **11,472** |\n\nThe overlap inventory and count summary are saved as [consensus_gene_symbol_overlap.csv](/home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/results/tables/consensus_gene_symbol_overlap.csv) and [consensus_gene_symbol_overlap_summary.csv](/home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/results/tables/consensus_gene_symbol_overlap_summary.csv).\n\nThe probe-level tables retain unmapped and ambiguous probes; those probes are excluded from symbol selection. Each selected table keeps one probe per unambiguous symbol, chosen by adjusted p-value, then absolute log2FC, then probe ID. The probe tables show multiple probes for 4,583 GSE5406 symbols and 779 GSE42955 symbols.\n\nI stopped before applying significance or direction rules, and did not commit anything.","date":"2026-11-24T08:10:46.658Z"}],"generating":false,"acp_log_store":"acp-log/home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/chat/dcm_agent.chat","acp_log_key":"ef7005ad-f4b3-4c83-a4ba-a5b43fa8b4fc:457fbc95-1d0f-4a78-8823-5cee882e88e9","acp_log_subject":"project.e3d18cfc-e2eb-46b5-9a2e-8cb41df2e6b8.acp-log.ef7005ad-f4b3-4c83-a4ba-a5b43fa8b4fc.457fbc95-1d0f-4a78-8823-5cee882e88e9","acp_started_at_ms":1795507727334,"acp_working_directory":"/home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/chat","acp_account_id":"6b19db69-db29-4124-a317-7e98612efdde","acp_runtime_kind":"codex","message_id":"457fbc95-1d0f-4a78-8823-5cee882e88e9","thread_id":"ef7005ad-f4b3-4c83-a4ba-a5b43fa8b4fc","parent_message_id":"5b6fb6bc-4817-4292-b889-ad3aa4b1c2a3","acp_thread_id":"01a20c06-79b7-78a3-8b91-8c2a6fe6b5a3","acp_usage":{"input_tokens":9397