{"event":"chat","sender_id":"gpt-6-luna","date":"2026-11-24T08:13:07.713Z","history":[{"author_id":"gpt-6-luna","content":"- **2 genes** were significant in both studies; **1 of 2 (50%)** had matching directions. **1 gene** passed the same direction rule.\n- The only consensus gene is **AASS**, downregulated in DCM in both studies. Its logFC was −0.524 in GSE5406 and −0.698 in GSE42955.\n\nSaved the [consensus table](</home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/results/tables/consensus_genes.csv>) and updated [Consensus_analysis.ipynb](</home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/notebooks/Consensus_analysis.ipynb>). The notebook publication was updated. **No commit was made.**","date":"2026-11-24T08:15:57.538Z"}],"generating":false,"acp_log_store":"acp-log/home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/chat/dcm_agent.chat","acp_log_key":"ef7005ad-f4b3-4c83-a4ba-a5b43fa8b4fc:6d301834-35b2-440f-86a3-e652c83a9d77","acp_log_subject":"project.e3d18cfc-e2eb-46b5-9a2e-8cb41df2e6b8.acp-log.ef7005ad-f4b3-4c83-a4ba-a5b43fa8b4fc.6d301834-35b2-440f-86a3-e652c83a9d77","acp_started_at_ms":1795507986718,"acp_working_directory":"/home/user/biom5350/biom5350-dcm-consensus/chat","acp_account_id":"6b19db69-db29-4124-a317-7e98612efdde","acp_runtime_kind":"codex","message_id":"6d301834-35b2-440f-86a3-e652c83a9d77","thread_id":"ef7005ad-f4b3-4c83-a4ba-a5b43fa8b4fc","parent_message_id":"a49c609b-6ec5-41d0-9342-f71321137ee0","acp_thread_id":"01a20c06-79b7-78a3-8b91-8c2a6fe6b5a3","acp_usage":{"input_tokens":65416,"cached_input_tokens":64486,"output_tokens":222,"reasoning_output_tokens":57,"total_tokens":65638,"model_context_window":121600},"acp_manager_finished":true,"acp_active_descendant_thread_ids":[],"acp_active_descendant_agents":0,"acp_subagent_limit_exceeded":false,"acp_background_terminal_processes":0,"acp_ai_usage_may_continue":false}
